[Event "Knight School"]
[Opening "Elephant Gambit"]
[Variation "3.Nxe5 dxe4 4.d4"]
[ECO "C40"]
[Character "gambit,sharp"]
[Risk "high"]
[EarlyMate "none"]
[Tricks "none"]
[Themes "development-lead,open-lines"]

1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 d5 3. Nxe5 dxe4 4. d4 (4. Bc4 Nh6 5. d4 Nd7 6. O-O Nxe5 7. dxe5 Qxd1) 4... Nd7 { Attacks the knight on e5 a second time, so White has to defend it or trade it off. }
5. Qe2 5... Nxe5 { Takes the knight before White can take on d7. } 6. dxe5 6... Qd4 { Attacks the pawn on e5 and puts the queen in the centre. When that pawn falls, material is level again. } 7. Nc3 7... Qxe5 { Wins the pawn back, so material is level. } 8. Qxe4 8... Qxe4+ 9. Nxe4 *
